WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.204
A hybrid AI architecture uses more than one execution environment and places work according to explicit requirements.

00:00:08.204 --> 00:00:13.746
Local workstations or private servers may handle sensitive or latency-critical tasks.

00:00:13.746 --> 00:00:17.516
Cloud GPUs can provide temporary accelerator capacity.

00:00:17.516 --> 00:00:27.936
Hosted model APIs can offer capabilities that are difficult to operate locally, while private cloud deployments extend organizational control into provider infrastructure.

00:00:27.936 --> 00:00:33.036
Hybrid does not mean sending every request to every environment.

00:00:33.036 --> 00:00:43.900
It means defining which components process which inputs, where data is stored, and how the system behaves when a preferred resource is unavailable.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:52.104
A local model and a cloud endpoint connected by an undocumented fallback are not a sound architecture.

00:00:52.104 --> 00:00:59.420
The routing policy, privacy boundary, authentication, logging, and failure behavior must be visible and testable.

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:02.302
The design balances competing objectives.

00:01:02.302 --> 00:01:11.836
Local execution can improve privacy, control, and predictable marginal cost, but it is limited by owned hardware and maintenance capacity.

00:01:11.836 --> 00:01:21.814
Cloud services offer elasticity, specialized models, and remote access, but introduce network latency, metered spending, provider dependency, and another data boundary.

00:01:21.814 --> 00:01:28.243
Reliability may improve through alternatives, or decrease if additional dependencies are poorly managed.

00:01:28.243 --> 00:01:35.117
Workload placement is an engineering decision, not an ideological commitment to local or cloud.

00:01:35.117 --> 00:01:41.103
Begin with data classification, user experience, model capability, volume, availability, and cost.

00:01:41.103 --> 00:01:47.976
Choose the simplest placement that satisfies them, document why, and measure the complete flow.

00:01:47.976 --> 00:01:54.849
A useful hybrid system gains flexibility without making data movement or operational responsibility ambiguous.
